{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120490","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120490/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120490/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120490/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120490","id":4707689619,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7oufBD","number":120490,"title":"[Polygon2D] Add weight soft painting, spinbox strength selection and weight set mode.","user":{"login":"CantyCanadian","id":7960042,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5NjAwNDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7960042?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CantyCanadian","html_url":"https://github.com/CantyCanadian","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CantyCanadian/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CantyCanadian/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CantyCanadian/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CantyCanadian/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CantyCanadian/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CantyCanadian/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CantyCanadian/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CantyCanadian/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CantyCanadian/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-06-20T17:15:42Z","updated_at":"2026-07-08T20:50:15Z","closed_at":"2026-07-08T20:06:22Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120490","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120490","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120490.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120490.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Closes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15061\r\n\r\nThis is my first PR so if I missed something, please let me know!\r\n\r\nThis PR adds new features to the Polygon2D Polygon edit panel based on \r\ncommonly found features in other weight-painting software.\r\n\r\n- Swapped the strength slider for a spinbox, allowing for more granular control.\r\n- Added the ability to set vertices to a specific weight instead of only relying on \r\nadding and subtracting.\r\n- Changed the icons for adding and subtracting weights to a 'plus' and 'minus' \r\nas the old 'paint bucket' and 'brush' didn't visually explain the features. If there \r\nwas a way to get an 'equal' icon added for the weight-setting, it'd be nice, but \r\nwithout it, I've used a 'brush' icon.\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n<img width=\"600\" height=\"448\" alt=\"add-sub-old\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/32bdaeeb-0c1c-4e07-8dde-3314d30b4e15\" />\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n<img width=\"600\" height=\"452\" alt=\"add-remove-set\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c79086ae-2cf3-487e-97ac-efa5a5fe2e16\" />\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n- Moved 'Grid', 'Snap' and 'Grid Settings' to a new 'Grid' submenu.\r\n- Since the 'Edit' submenu only contains 'UV'-related options, I moved it to the \r\n'UV' selection mode.\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n<img width=\"600\" height=\"448\" alt=\"submenu-old\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7c241b95-725c-4ff7-9fc6-ca0ba0d1da0d\" />\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n<img width=\"600\" height=\"400\" alt=\"submenus\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f6a82e64-172e-49b3-b257-49d1bddc8d78\" />\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n- While for polygon/vertex mode, not acknowledging clicking without moving is \r\nnormal behavior, for paint mode, it is expected that rapidly clicking causes painting \r\neven if the mouse isn't moving. That issue is now fixed.\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n<img width=\"600\" height=\"448\" alt=\"no-move-paint-old\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3dc6d802-8140-464f-a3b4-28a44769c2bd\" />\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n<img width=\"600\" height=\"448\" alt=\"no-move-paint\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/288a980a-e7b7-4c45-b4d3-7f817ca65bd3\" />\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n- Added soft weight painting, using 3DS Max's soft selection algorithm as inspiration.\r\n- Includes 'Inner Radius' (if inside, set to max strength), 'Pinch' (narrows/extends peak) \r\nand 'Bubble' (flat addition to middle).\r\n- Cursor reflects modification to variables, visualizing brush curve.\r\n- Slight changes to painting behavior only in soft painting. Vertices in soft paint remembers \r\nthe highest/lowest value they were at during a single brush stroke. This means that a \r\nvertex starting outside the brush, then being painted over, will not revert to 0 if it leaves \r\nthe brush during the stroke.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"600\" height=\"448\" alt=\"soft-paint\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/847e49c9-f212-4fbb-ab45-922c31afaae3\" />\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"CantyCanadian","id":7960042,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5NjAwNDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7960042?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CantyCanadian","html_url":"https://github.com/CantyCanadian","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CantyCanadian/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CantyCanadian/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CantyCanadian/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CantyCanadian/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CantyCanadian/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CantyCanadian/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CantyCanadian/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CantyCanadian/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CantyCanadian/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120490/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120490/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}